 'His breath halted in his throat, watching the flame flicker before snuffing itself. The windows were closed and the air was still, stagnant, almost, though with that sickeningly sweet aroma which permeated through the personal quarters of Dunwall Tower.                   Frozen static from confusion, his eyes slowly adjusting to the new darkness, the pulsing in his ears changed, now outer body, now something else. He forced himself to swallow thickly, listening to the thrum that was almost like a grind, and he knew it too well.                 “I don’t like to be ignored, Corvo,”'$f$, 4365, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-27T13:25:19.616+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-27T13:25:19.708+00:00$f$, $f$2012-12-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
