($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 740815, $f$silhouette and nothing more$f$, ARRAY[$f$orphan_account$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Les Misérables - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Written for a prompt on the Les Mis kink meme: "Grown-up Gavroche/Montparnasse. Consensual and canon-era, please, and would appreciate bookverse Gav's massive confidence and basic assumption that he's equal to everyone. Knifeplay a bonus." [x]$f$, 1331, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-06-12T07:04:33.420+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-12T07:04:33.795+00:00$f$, $f$2013-03-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 744339, $f$As You Wish$f$, ARRAY[$f$rubyofkukundu$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When it comes down to it, Arthur is rather privileged. There aren't many in service who'd give up the chance to work as a valet for the heir of the Brinsley family. He gets good meals, a good wage, a crisp set of clothes, and if he plays his cards right, he may even make his way up to butler by the time he's 30: a worthy achievement by all counts. He's well-liked. He's respected. And, God help him, he thinks he might be in love.$f$, 8349, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-01-24T12:38:28.171+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-24T12:38:28.240+00:00$f$, $f$2010-07-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
