($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 785565, $f$The Mechanical Turk$f$, ARRAY[$f$ladysisyphus$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Throughout the entire trip -- from the hired cab to the docks, on the ferry across the Channel, through all three days' worth of train travel across what seemed like half the world, to the last ascent by horse-drawn carriage up into the verdant peaks of the Meček Mountains, right up to the great wrought iron doors of the ancient stone castle -- Halston Barwick's one constant companion had been the slightly dumbfounded thought: How on earth did I get myself into this?$f$, 6753, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-01-27T02:07:22.133+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-27T02:07:22.223+00:00$f$, $f$2009-01-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 786069, $f$Hand Beneath His Boot$f$, ARRAY[$f$orphan_account$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Tobin Lewis has done crazy, terrible, illegal things to support his little brother when his drug-addled mother falls short.  Surly, violent and defensive, he's hurt others and himself.  He's only a good Omega when people pay him to be and his body's been on sale since he was 16.  
How much more will he have to give when the worst happens and he's faced with a desperate gamble or losing his little brother forever?$f$, 31817, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-01-23T06:06:20.239+00:00$f$, $f$2019-01-23T06:06:20.301+00:00$f$, $f$2013-07-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
