($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 1626899, $f$Circumspect$f$, ARRAY[$f$rosekay$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2017-12-30T05:52:34.877+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-30T05:52:34.969+00:00$f$, $f$2007-12-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 1652000, $f$Unfortunate Circumstances$f$, ARRAY[$f$antikytheras$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There are two particular officers in the City Watch who keep getting placed in compromising positions after being knocked out by a phantom menace. In other words, you know how you always dump guards on top of each other and then kinda giggle to yourself? Think about the poor, poor guards sometime.$f$, 2054, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-17T21:35:51.376+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-17T21:35:51.418+00:00$f$, $f$2014-05-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 1895772, $f$The Assassin's Wedding$f$, ARRAY[$f$ms_prue$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lucarno, Therim Pel's most famous playwright, author of such beloved classics as "The Tragedy of the Ten Honest Turncoats", "The Empire of Seven Days" and of course "The Assassin's Wedding".Anfisa, assassin for hire, has been caught in the act by her intended victim, a Prince of the realm. Her body and her life are now forfeit, but instead of throwing her in prison, the Prince has a more unusual idea of justice.Lucio, the Prince's friend and assassin on behalf of the throne, pines for true love but despairs of finding a wife who can reconcile herself to his bloody calling. At the Prince's command, Anfisa is delivered to Lucio to become his bride. But will the couple find happiness, or poisoned daggers in their backs?WHAT DO CRITICS HAVE TO SAY ABOUT THE GREAT LUCARNO?"*****" -- Jean Tannen"Mawkish sentiment, obvious self-satisfaction and so many little puns about fucking." -- Captain Jaffrim Rodanov"Your brains will go soft with all that mush." -- Locke Lamora$f$, 1239, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2018-12-30T05:15:16.002+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-30T05:15:16.047+00:00$f$, $f$2014-07-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 1897893, $f$Tempting A God$f$, ARRAY[$f$carvedwhalebones (fuckyeahlucifersupernatural)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"But Corvo doesn’t want what power sits within the god. He doesn’t care for thrones nor the ability to scry. He just wants to push his fingers into the fabric of the entity’s being and taste the crackle of energy off the hollow of his throat."$f$, 2468, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-27T13:25:43.263+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-27T13:25:43.347+00:00$f$, $f$2014-07-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
