($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2050011, $f$Shelter From The Storm$f$, ARRAY[$f$Solanaceae$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Morwen and Niënor flee Dor-lómin and end up in Nargothrond, a chain of events are set in motion that will change – and perhaps save – many lives. Finduilas, on the other hand, isn't sure that this Niënor girl is entertaining enough company to make up for how irritating she can be.Written for ParadifeLoft at the 2014 Ardor in August exchange.$f$, 5931, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-06-08T03:16:40.556+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-08T03:16:40.700+00:00$f$, $f$2014-07-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2076780, $f$Fellowship of the Slightly Awkward Deeply Concerned Citizens Regarding An Ex God$f$, ARRAY[$f$Asariboyfriend (skyjacklegion)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Fugue Feast work for Maliks-butt with the following prompts I was supposed to just choose one but I did them all? Sort of?1) Fed up and world weary Outsider spent past millennium plotting own destruction but in a less anticipated turn of events becomes human and finds himself living in Dunwall Tower where Corvo has to deal with his newly found range of emotions, unsociable + eccentric conduct and complete disregard for personal space. 2) Corvo+the Outsider smooching. kudos if one of them (or BOTH of them) is all hot and bothered. 3) Emily has to get used to that strange uncle with black eyes. 4) Corvo drowning$f$, 4599, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-06-28T11:10:05.707+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-28T11:10:05.798+00:00$f$, $f$2014-08-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
