($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2250624, $f$the moon sets these sins on fire; this little hell is searing me to the bone$f$, ARRAY[$f$theivoryshadow$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He turns his hands over, staring at the callouses. He has long since washed Pietro's blood from them, scrubbing his hands until they were raw and cracked, but it makes no difference. To him, they are stained with red. He can't possibly wash it out. Slowly, he turns his hands back over again, resting them in his lap, stilling them as if they were dangerous. They are.$f$, 3732, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-07-19T03:00:52.687+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-19T03:00:52.780+00:00$f$, $f$2014-09-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
