($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2318156, $f$The Return$f$, ARRAY[$f$tricksterity$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The High Overseer’s door was open, and Corvo walked in without hesitation. Templeton turned around to him with what was more a smirk than a smile, and Corvo barely had any time to register what was happening before the floor was rushing up to meet him.$f$, 1146, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-27T11:57:15.015+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-27T11:57:15.080+00:00$f$, $f$2014-09-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2358674, $f$Penny Dreadful$f$, ARRAY[$f$Mickleditch$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Oliver! - Bart$f$, $f$Oliver Twist - Charles Dickens$f$, $f$Oliver Twist - All Media Types$f$, $f$DICKENS Charles - Works$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$[A sequel to the one-shot 'Cherrystones', which you should read first]. When a chance conversation alerts Oliver Brownlow to the fact that his old companion, Jack Dawkins, may be headed for trouble, he sets out to warn him, but instead becomes responsible for an escapade which will finally convince him where his deepest feelings lie. Contains m/m erotica.$f$, 66151, 13, 13, true, 5, false, $f$2019-08-19T16:21:22.105+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-19T16:21:22.229+00:00$f$, $f$2014-11-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
