($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2825597, $f$Dragonslayer$f$, ARRAY[$f$DonLambert$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$, $f$The Hobbit - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$, $f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The night before the battle Thranduil invites Bard back to his tent in Dale and the two kings share in each other’s company.$f$, 5671, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-08-20T11:53:05.619+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-20T11:53:05.673+00:00$f$, $f$2014-12-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2838104, $f$The Westphalian Affair$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Les Misérables - Victor Hugo$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After a Prussian Baroness steals Courfeyrac's dog, Courfeyrac and his loyal friend Marius undertake a long winter's journey to her Westphalian estate in order to retrieve their own pup. Along the way, they encounter inadequate lodgings, women in trousers, and moments of sexual tension. The Baroness, however, has her own plans for the two, involving marriage and perhaps even a murder in order to inherit her grandfather's estates - and her grandfather has his own grievance with the Courfeyracs...$f$, 8533, 4, 4, true, 5, false, $f$2019-06-08T14:59:24.170+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-08T14:59:24.529+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2845532, $f$Five and One Eighth Times* Archie Curtis Tried Something New$f$, ARRAY[$f$daisysusan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$*Six, if you ask Daniel. After some debate, "Several Times Archie Curtis Tried Something New" was agreed on. Post-book porn with feelings.$f$, 5577, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-03-01T03:33:50.741+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-01T03:33:50.841+00:00$f$, $f$2014-12-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2907791, $f$Theft By Consent$f$, ARRAY[$f$LuckyDiceKirby$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Les Misérables - All Media Types$f$, $f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"The political system here is a sham," Enjolras began, and R put the other hand over his face as well, because Enjolras was beautiful, and idealistic, and very, very stupid, and they were probably both going to die because of it." Gentleman Bastards AU.(Or: the one where Enjolras thinks fucking with the Bondsmagi is a good idea.)$f$, 6604, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-07-21T17:49:14.754+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-21T17:49:14.995+00:00$f$, $f$2014-12-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 2954159, $f$On Icy Wings$f$, ARRAY[$f$pasiphile$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Discworld - Terry Pratchett$f$, $f$Monstrous Regiment - Terry Pratchett$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2017-12-02T19:05:13.468+00:00$f$, $f$2017-12-02T19:05:13.527+00:00$f$, $f$2014-12-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3118394, $f$Coming Home$f$, ARRAY[$f$LittleLynn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$, $f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It had been fairly obvious, at least to Bard and the other elves (luckily the other men hadn’t realised) that Thranduil had been delaying his departure as much as possible. In theory, Bard was the only one who knew exactly why Thranduil was still there, and it was not so the king could ‘continue negotiations and help the people of Laketown rebuild Dale’. Bard knew it had far more to do with the ‘official business’ he had to carry out with the 'king' of Dale; almost every night.$f$, 4678, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:20:35.515+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:20:35.546+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3122303, $f$through the night and the starry splendour.$f$, ARRAY[$f$wolfhalls$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Bard,” and Bard tries not to think about how his name sounds carried by Thranduil's voice, slow and deep. “Tell me that we are friends.”“I am your friend, Thranduil,” and that sounds stranger still, an old name like that on Bard's rough lips. “You'll find none truer. I have little appetite for drinking, or feuding, which is where we differ – but I admire you. Truly."$f$, 5691, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-08-20T16:28:00.509+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-20T16:28:00.691+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3131804, $f$The Void$f$, ARRAY[$f$InsatiableSquire$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A 12 sentence story variation of the beginning, this was just a assignment for class so I did it and decided to post it here. It's only minor Outsider/Corvo, and Past Corvo/Jessamine. The torture isn't graphic just brief description since I needed it to be 12 sentences.$f$, 539, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-07-12T04:59:16.595+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-12T04:59:16.687+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3132929, $f$The Lions' Den$f$, ARRAY[$f$eleanor_lavish$f$, $f$Rhea314 (Rhea)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$With Archie and Daniel working closely on a number of hush-hush cases for the government, Sir Henry apparently feels the need to vet Daniel as a partner (no doubt based on some not-so-savory tidbits about him shared by Sir Maurice). So when Archie had been summoned for a weekend with his uncle, recently returned from South Africa with his good friend Captain Good, Daniel’s name was conspicuously included on the invitation.$f$, 9976, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2025-05-03T04:27:42.559+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-03T04:27:42.560+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3172320, $f$Starless Night$f$, ARRAY[$f$oscarwilderobbieross$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Thranduil is the lead singer of the world famous band Mirkwood, but once their lead guitarist walks out to start his own project,  they need another member. Nobody could have prepared him for Bard, and nobody could have prepared Bard for Thranduil. Amidst cheering fans and sweat, they find each other in late nights and hotel rooms.$f$, 6301, 10, 10, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:34:15.572+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:34:15.587+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3174044, $f$The Dream$f$, ARRAY[$f$AllThatWeSeeOrSeem$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$, $f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The three of them are in one big bed, and he knows by it's impossibility that it is a dream, but he wouldn't want to be woken now for anything in all the world. Set post BOTFA.$f$, 5080, 6, 6, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:29:09.896+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:29:09.910+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3177055, $f$The latest dream I ever dreamed on the cold hill’s side$f$, ARRAY[$f$acaramelmacchiato$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$from hob kink meme. prompt is: "I like the idea of Thranduil courting Bard, like a lot. But I imagine being old as dirt, the sass king's idea of flirting has been out of style for centuries."$f$, 2925, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-02-08T12:32:01.964+00:00$f$, $f$2019-02-08T12:32:02.043+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3179360, $f$Everything At Once$f$, ARRAY[$f$captaineifersucht$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In Bard’s house, atop his bed, in the room separated only by a thin wall from a similar one where two girls slept.$f$, 650, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:23:14.663+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:23:14.707+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3181988, $f$the murky mass of your marvellous hair has twined my heart in its maze.$f$, ARRAY[$f$wolfhalls$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He writes to Thranduil once, tries to convey how grateful he is – but Bard has never been one for soft verses or poetry, cannot coax that warm feeling in his chest to turn into words on the paper. His penmanship is clumsy at best, he's not had the luxury of being taught to write in perfect, sloping lines. So the letter is ill written and ink-blotched, and Bard wonders if Thranduil would laugh to look at it.A reply doesn't come. The ice covering Dale thaws – and Bard stops waiting.
            
            the title of this chapter is taken from here comes the night time ii by arcade fire. go listen to it.$f$, 12876, 2, 2, true, 1, false, $f$2019-08-21T04:11:14.862+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-21T04:11:14.927+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3183869, $f$Alone Under the Starlight$f$, ARRAY[$f$LittleLynn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$, $f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Fine.” Bard sighed, getting ready to outline his rules, but before he could a drowsy voice spoke.“Courting a king’s daughter without permission, terrible. He can’t have you, he’s not good enough.” Thranduil protested.“You’ve not even met him.” “Doesn’t matter, he’s still not good enough. Couldn’t possibly be.” Sigrid beamed at the Elvenking’s affection, Bard knew he held her with as much love as if she were his own. He did for all Bard’s children. But watching the way Sigrid smiled at his kind words made his heart squeeze.“No unchaperoned dates. No outings after eight. No sneaking out. And absolutely no husband for at least five years.” Bard reeled off.“Twenty.” Thranduil grumbled against Bard’s chest, making them both grin.$f$, 2863, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:20:15.692+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:20:15.739+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3194909, $f$Linked$f$, ARRAY[$f$SP00K$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2017-10-19T05:40:17.408+00:00$f$, $f$2017-10-19T05:40:17.425+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3213263, $f$Kingly$f$, ARRAY[$f$DonLambert$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit - All Media Types$f$, $f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$, $f$The Hobbit - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 9513, 3, 3, true, 3, false, $f$2019-08-21T11:27:34.593+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-21T11:27:34.640+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 3220484, $f$in my arms till break of day$f$, ARRAY[$f$vesna (mrsronweasley)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Think of England - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Months into having a partner rather more inclined towards violence as solution than himself, and it still rattled Daniel's brain and other, less conscious parts. Parts such as slithering fear, ready at any moment to transform into withering cowardice, and – other ones. There were many parts within him that reacted to violence nowadays.Or, Daniel develops a bit of a fetish.$f$, 7223, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2025-05-03T12:44:14.595+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-03T12:44:14.598+00:00$f$, $f$2015-01-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
